## Today's class row (UI-06). Loaded with its lazy chunk (`ClassToday`), for shala members only.
# The row's label; the line under it is put together from the parts below, " · " between them,
# and ends with the shala's name.
today-class-title = 🗓 Today's class
# $type: "Mysore". $time: "07:00 Almaty" (my zone).
today-class = { $type } · { $time }
# The class's own clock when it differs from mine: "17:30" + "Berlin (UTC+1)".
today-class-there = { $time } { $zone }
today-class-more = +{ $n } more
